{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "CELADON CYCLING FILL — Maps 146, 517, 518, 193, 204.",
    "Routes 16-18: Cycling Road and surrounding areas.",
    "Tone: Open road. Competitive cyclists, bikers, some awareness of world events.",
    "These NPCs are outside Celadon's bubble — rougher, more direct.",
    "",
    "MECHANICAL EVENTS PRESERVED (not modified):",
    "- Map 146: ALL trainer battle triggers preserved (rematch choices preserved)",
    "- Map 146 EV005-EV008: Sludge cleanup events (Bleeeergh + cycling road clear)",
    "- Map 146 EV003/EV031: Bike race timer/checkpoint events",
    "- Map 146 EV026: Quest bike challenge intro",
    "- Map 146 EV012 (page 1+): Item gift after battle",
    "- Map 146 EV013 (page 1+): Bulldozer/construction + item gift",
    "- Map 146 EV014: Money theft event ($4500 gift)",
    "- Map 517: ALL pumpkin events (EV026-EV032 — Pumpkaboo encounters)",
    "- Map 517: Hidden item events (EV007-EV012)",
    "- Map 517 EV020: Moo Moo Milk shop",
    "- Map 517 EV021: Miltank cry",
    "- Map 518 EV004: Cycling Road bike gate",
    "- Map 193 EV001/EV002: Wildlife info boards",
    "- Map 193 EV009: Sucker Punch move tutor (ALL mechanics)",
    "- Map 204: Farmhouse — berry gift (EV012) + mulch purchase (EV013)",
    "- Map 204: Container/picture checks (EV008-EV010)",
    "",
    "Only trainer pre/post-battle flavor and standalone NPC lines rewritten.",
    "All rematch choice menus, item gifts, and battle triggers preserved.",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line for RPG Maker XP text box."
  ],
  "maps": {
    "146": {
      "name": "Route 17 (Cycling Road)",
      "events": {
        "16": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) (Biker — Top of Road)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Nice bike. How's it handle",
                    "on the slope? The road's been",
                    "rough since Rocket stopped",
                    "maintaining it."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The slope makes it hard to",
                    "steer! Especially when you're",
                    "dodging wild Pok\u00e9mon."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "38": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) (Biker — Speed Demon)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "C'mon c'mon c'mon! No time",
                    "to talk! Only time to ride!",
                    "And fight! Mostly fight!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What what what? You want",
                    "something? I'm busy doing",
                    "absolutely nothing at speed!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "11": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) (Biker — Bike Critic)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What kind of puny bike is",
                    "that? I've seen better wheels",
                    "on a Magnemite."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Looking for adventure?",
                    "Fuchsia's got Safari Zone.",
                    "Celadon's got corruption.",
                    "Take your pick."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "17": {
          "name": "Trainer(2) (Biker — Rebel)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Be a rebel! Question the",
                    "League! Question Erika!",
                    "Question everything!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Be ready to fight for what",
                    "you believe in. Even if what",
                    "you believe in changes."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "12": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) (Biker — Highway Star)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We're bikers! Highway stars!",
                    "Free from Celadon's politics",
                    "and Fuchsia's weirdness."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Good stuff lies around on the",
                    "road. People drop things when",
                    "they're riding scared."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "13": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) (Biker — Builder)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "No money in fighting kids.",
                    "I'm building rest areas now.",
                    "Someone has to maintain this",
                    "road. The city sure doesn't."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We're hauling dirt by boat to",
                    "build a proper rest stop."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Celadon won't fund it. Too",
                    "busy funding the Game Corner.",
                    "Here, take this and help out."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "14": {
          "name": "Trainer(3) (Biker — Thief)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Stop! Hand over your money!",
                    "This is Cycling Road rules.",
                    "Might makes right out here."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Don't hurt me! Take my money,",
                    "take it all! I learned this",
                    "from the Game Corner \u2014",
                    "the house always wins."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "9": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) (Biker — Fuchsia Bound)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Heading to Fuchsia? Smart.",
                    "Koga runs a tight city.",
                    "No Game Corners, no open",
                    "secrets. Just poison and fog."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Love racing downhill. It's",
                    "the one place nobody asks",
                    "where you're from or who",
                    "you work for."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "15": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) (Biker — Exercise)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I need exercise! Sitting in",
                    "Celadon all day watching the",
                    "Game Corner makes you soft."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'm sure I lost weight there!",
                    "Fighting on the road beats",
                    "fighting in the sewers."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "10": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) (Biker — Rule Breaker)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "They say you need a bike on",
                    "Cycling Road. I never liked",
                    "rules. Rules are how Celadon",
                    "pretends everything's fine."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Rules exist so the people in",
                    "charge can break them first."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
